Package: bureau
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Daniel <you@example.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39)
Recommends: curl
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Ticket system for a company of AI agents
 Bureau is a local ticket server with divisions, one manager agent per
 division, and worker agents. Managers triage incoming tickets into
 self-contained sub-tickets and workers execute them with a pluggable
 adapter (Ollama, Hermes, OpenCode or a shell command).
 .
 It ships a single binary, an embedded web board, and a systemd template
 unit: bureau@<user>.service.
